2. Unicode Common Locale Data Repository (CLDR), release 49
   https://github.com/unicode-org/cldr
   Files: common/subdivisions/en.xml, common/subdivisions/de.xml
   Used for: most English names (data/names/en.php) and German names that
   Debian iso-codes does not translate or marks as fuzzy
   (data/names/de.php).
