Changes: the data files are a modified version of these sources, changed by
GoSuccess GmbH. tools/generate.php converts them to PHP arrays, picks one
name per subdivision and language from the sources above, and skips CLDR
names whose key stands for another subdivision than in ISO 3166-2 today
(listed in tools/sources.php). The header of each data file states its
sources and the date of its last change. Nothing else is changed.

Source: tools/ ships with the package. `php tools/generate.php` downloads the
sources pinned with version and SHA-256 in tools/sources.php and rebuilds
data/ exactly; the data files themselves are readable PHP.
